    {
      "title": "共学 D8：11 个机会候选只剩 3 个，清单是怎么筛出来的",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第八天官方任务 L0008：11 个候选过五问筛选，3 个进清单（PM 天气/吃尸体/费率事件窗口）",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span>TECH NOTES</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">共学 D8：11 个机会候选只剩 3 个，清单是怎么筛出来的</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">第八天官方任务 L0008：11 个候选过五问筛选，3 个进清单（PM 天气/吃尸体/费率事件窗口），挂掉的全挂在「30 天证据」。同日实测：PM 返佣流水 1.9 倍实证、低容量量化、80 资产 OFT 全扫无肉、GMEB 窗口衰减。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">WEB3 · DEV</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D8：11 个机会候选只剩 3 个，清单是怎么筛出来的</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 8 天\n2026-08-12</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第八天是官方路线图的关键节点 L0008：机会候选清单 v1。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">前一天沉淀的 5 问筛选框架（税前口径 / 成本占比 / 返佣依赖 / 样本窗口 / 最小有效规模）第一次派上大用场。11 个候选方向过完五问，只有 3 个进了清单。更值钱的是清单之外的收获：挂掉的候选，全部挂在同一个问题上。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这天同时也是密集实验日：PM 返佣流水三分账、低容量可行域量化、80 个多链资产全扫、bStocks 事件线实况，全是在给清单供证据。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论先说：机会清单的意义不是「找到能赚钱的方向」，而是「把还没有证据的方向明明白白挂起」。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、L0008：11 进 3，五问定生死</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">候选池 = 研究线 backlog 14 个方向 × Bruce 14 类对照 × 本周全部实测（网格 / Polymarket / gas 反杀 / TUT / DOS / 888BMM）。每个候选过五问：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">最小有效规模可承受？</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">净收益公式为正？</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">样本是否只覆盖友好窗口？</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">有无返佣/补贴支撑？</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">有无 30 天以上真实净收益证据（含失败）？</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>PM 天气「几成定局」</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>✅ 进清单</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>事件驱动「吃尸体」（TUT/下架/插针）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>✅ 进清单</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>跨所资金费率事件窗口</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>✅ 进清单</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>RWA/币股闭市漂移</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 待验证（30 天数据）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>链上 perp funding 拥挤度</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 待验证</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>低容量结构性价差（#13）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 待验证</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>PM rebalancing 盘口套利</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 观察</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>PM 带方向 LP</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 计划（先 paper 验证返佣）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>OFT 跨链价差（DOS 线）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>🟡 监控（等上币窗口）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>Cosmos 偏门跨链</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>❌ 暂缓（未核查）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">候选方向</span>Meme 壳价 + Dev 状态机</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">判定</span>❌ 不列（博弈非套利）</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">进清单的 3 个，全部有真实证据：</strong></p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">PM 天气「几成定局」</strong>：已实盘验证（日化 3% + 600 笔公开案例互证）；容量 $300/天/市场是硬约束，按多市场复制扩展；尾部风险 = 极端天气 + 多市场相关性</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">事件驱动吃尸体</strong>：下架合约 439bps + TUT 插针 16.16% 窗口双案例验证；低频高幅；价差 + 爆仓量两因子判窗口</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">跨所资金费率事件窗口</strong>：TUT 生命周期完整实证（正常期吃费率 → 异动止损 → 逼空观望 → 收敛）；与吃尸体共用监控基建</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">挂掉的候选，全部挂在同一个问题</strong>：⑤ 30 天证据。没有长期真实净收益记录（含失败记录）的方向，不进实盘清单。五问的筛选力就在这里——它不淘汰「可能性」，只淘汰「没证据」。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、PM 返佣流水三分账：第④问的实证课</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">清单里「PM 带方向 LP」标了计划，先 paper 验证返佣流水。当天就用 leaderboard 头部账户的真实 /activity 数据跑了一版：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">实锤案例 0x204f</strong>：7 天返佣 $9.47K = 纯交易 $5.0K 的 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">1.9 倍</strong>——去掉返佣是亏损的</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">5 问第④问「返佣/补贴依赖度」被真实数据钉死：返佣支撑的表面收益，剥掉返佣立刻现形</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">0x6d20 案例：榜单口径 420% vs 真实到手（gross 不含费用）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这就是五问的价值：不是理论说教，是任何地址都能用 activity 事件流重建验证的硬方法。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、低容量可行域量化：#13 假设成立</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">研究线 #13「低容量结构性价差」从 🟡 转 ✅：2.3 天 501 个样本（剔除两个损坏数据源后）：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">「薄池价差持续更久」假设成立</strong>：薄池对出轨率 100% vs 深池对 54%</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">持续时长：薄池 3-7 小时 vs 深池 <2 小时</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">容量边界 ≈ 100 SOL/笔（走廊含冲击项，大档出轨率下降）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">数据质量发现：Aquifer（+150 万 bps）和 Manifest（+12 万 bps）的报价是损坏的——雷达需要异常值过滤。这个方向还在等竞争度维度，但可行性已经量化。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、OFT 全扫：80 个资产，0 口可执行</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">三步法闭环（找多链币 → 询价 → 判定）跑完整个 playbook：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">LayerZero 官方 playbook：361 个已验证 OFT 资产 / 653 部署 / 704 活跃 peer 路径</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">升级到地址级扫描后，假币池彻底消失（symbol 搜索必撞假币：DAPPOS 挂着 DOS 符号，1755 亿枚）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">冒头候选 IMD Base→ETH +438.8bps（$476K 深度）→ LI.FI 桥费核验：路由损耗 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">-1065bps</strong>，价差被吃 2.4 倍 → NO-GO</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">结论：当前时刻 80 个资产无一口可执行正价差</strong></td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">过滤器如实报空 = 正确输出。工具链已经就绪，bStocks 新品/新批次公告一到就能复用。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、bStocks 事件线：GMEB 窗口实况</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">「明天新品」实锤 = 当天 GMEB：08-12 20:00 上市（零挂单费 + 零费 Convert）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">上市 3.5 小时后检查表：Binance +5bps（定价准）/ BSC 主池 +40bps（$598K 深度）→ 两腿毛 +32bps 扣费 ≈ 0 → 观察级无肉。窗口衰减数据：GME 热股数小时收敛。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">TradFi perp 批次确认是亚洲股票：快手 / 美团 / 韩华 2x / 三星 2x——老白「亚洲差异化」论点落地。硬约束也记下了：赎回 KYC 单腿风险、非交易时段 API 拒绝、quoteId 30s、流动性薄。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">六、附带勘误：L0006 的 25bps 地板不是地板</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">跨链实验复测发现：<code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">integrator=jumper.exchange</code> 参数让 LI.FI 平台费全档归零（到账 100% vs 默认 99.75%）。<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">D6 的「25bps 恒定地板」修正为「默认参数的渠道费」</strong>——跨链门槛整体下移 25bps。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">但同一天 DOS 重测证伪了反向假设：LI.FI 对 BSC→ETH 全 404，DOS 走 LayerZero 原生 OFT 桥，与 LI.FI 平台费无关。新发现：<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">LI.FI 覆盖 ≠ 全链</strong>，聚合器查不到 ≠ 路径不存在。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">七、工程产出（当天全部实测）</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>L0008 机会候选清单 v1（11 候选 × 5 问总表）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>PM rebalancing 盘口扫描器 v1.1（300 市场 0 信号 = 正常态）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>PM 返佣流水三分账验证（0x204f 返佣 1.9 倍实锤）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>L0006 integrator 复测（16 组全矩阵，25bps 可归零）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>#13 低容量可行域量化 v1（薄池 100% 出轨率 vs 深池 54%）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>OFT 地址级扫描（80 资产全扫 + IMD 桥费核验）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>bStocks 事件响应检查表 v1（公告→ticker→池深→净价差）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">产出</span>Solana 执行层哨兵体检 + 补挂 2 个 cron</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">状态</span>✅</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">方法论沉淀</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">机会清单的意义是把「没证据的方向」明明白白挂起，不是收藏「可能赚钱的方向」</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">筛选力来自淘汰规则：五问的第五问（30 天真实净收益证据）筛掉了大多数</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">返佣支撑的表面收益，用事件流三分账一剥就现形——任何地址可审计</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">过滤器如实报空 = 正确输出；工具链就绪，等窗口比乱开枪强</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">聚合器覆盖 ≠ 全链：查不到 ≠ 路径不存在，成本模型按实际桥核算</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天做什么</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">L0009 知识图谱 v1（L0008 清单的输入）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">AMM 数学第二讲：CLMM 可视化</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">backrun 薄池扫描并入 #13（容量 × 持续时间 × 竞争度三维可行域）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">关于本次共学</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">本系列来自「链上套利残酷共学」——由 Bruce Xu 发起的 21 天实践型共学（2026.08.05-08.26），692 位伙伴围绕机会发现、成本验证、策略构建、信号监控与执行复盘，用真实证据逼近答案，不做只听概念不落地的学习。活动详情：intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205</p>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKaybMrf0BOvmibwnUyIScS2wfxYuOLiaibM4xpEdhHhP3jF2qTnzNQSHQTj7QHHLW84JZLkAqrOWUBOMk9v0ovmRpBODOiaUf1mfyoY/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawmdmrmEciaAW6TvUoibwqILM6ExtdUzhTRBwibzG9oJPaB7vz2nFEW3uFZsDqrYrviamJqxFVjBs47kDfMa3JJP4FoBM0sw3ObSqU/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
